give the user the ways to load it (in Claude Code, claude plugin install vloop@vloop --scope project, after claude plugin marketplace add mvelosop/vloop if Claude does not know the marketplace, or claude --plugin-dir "$(vloop plugin path)"; in Copilot CLI, trust this folder, since .claude/settings.json declares the plugin, or copilot plugin install vloop@vloop after copilot plugin marketplace add mvelosop/vloop, or copilot --plugin-dir "$(vloop plugin path)")
